genius comes in many different forms and  the best kind makes our lives easy to  appreciate that kind of functional  creativity i found some amazing tools  that are on another level this is not a  drill join me as i take you through  these tools and tell you why i found  them to be on another level mini water  tap turbine starting us off is jasper  pew's mini water tap turbine have you  ever used a tap with low water pressure  well this 3d printed mini tap turbine  whose design was based on a cross flow  turbine is the solution to that problem  its function is to improve low water  pressure in taps by concentrating the  flow of water and releasing it as a  faster stream to use it attach it to the  mouth of the tap and as the turbine  spins the water pressure improves if  water pressure has never been a problem  in your area then this is a great tool  to have in your travel bag just in case  your travel destination's water pressure  needs a little extra help chopper one  axe  you better be ready for another  exceptionally functional axe because it  exists the chopper one axe helps you  easily split the wood with every strike  its specially engineered axe head has  rotating levels that use the energy  exerted when striking the wood to push  outwards ensuring that it splits down  the middle every time unlike a regular  rax with this one the probability of  hitting the same spot multiple times to  get a thick log to split is  significantly reduced it's a great tool  to show off and earn survival skill  points even if you're a first timer  reaper wheels  speaking of travelling next we have the  reaper wheels these wheels are on a  totally different level and will  transform your normal ice buggy into a  death trap and something from a horror  movie the reaper wheels allow you to  travel on ice without slipping like  ordinary wheels these wheels are made  entirely out of metal spikes that are  supposed to give the ice buggy a better  grip on ice not sure how many people  would want to transform their vehicles  like this so it's a good thing they're  removable one thing is for sure though  if i ever visit antarctica these are  coming with me efox professional  cordless tile beater from the wheels of  death to a more practical tool the efox  professional cordless vibrator tile  beater is a tool used to eliminate air  bubbles that may be trapped below tile  slabs once installed why do we need it  you may ask well if bubbles aren't  removed when the adhesive sets the air  will create a vacuum that may cause  cracks in the future now that we've  established its importance let's take a  closer look at the tool itself the efox  professional cordless vibrator tile  beater has multiple handles and an  adjustable vibrating area to cater to  both big and small surfaces on a single  charge the battery can work on 150 to  200 square meters and has a guaranteed  battery life of up to 100 000 square  meters now that's a lot of safe tiles  brush grubber extreme  moving along next is the brush grubber  extreme tool using its tooth claws the  brush grubber extreme tool easily pulls  shallow rooted trees up to six inches in  diameter from the ground to eliminate  regrowth it has two large total gripping  teeth per pad and spring-loaded jaws to  ensure a strong and secure hole the jaws  open wide to handle bigger trees and the  grip pads rotate 360 degrees to help  avoid debarking this powerful tool can  be operated by one person it can attach  to any atv pickup or lawn tractor to  provide the pulling force the brush  grubber extreme tool has surely taken  de-rooting trees to another level and  made it any man's sport timber croc log  holder the timber croc log holder as the  name suggests safely and securely holds  logs pallets and planks while they are  being cut using its patented teeth  design it was invented designed and  manufactured in ireland timber croc log  holder's design was copyright approved  and patent protected as the original  timber croc this tool holds a log  without any other support and its  heavy-duty version can grip logs  exceeding 20 kilograms both eliminate  many of the dangers traditionally  associated with log cutting and make log  cutting a job for one person as if  that's not enough it also stands higher  off the ground with enough clearance to  wheel a small trailer underneath that  will catch the falling logs if you ask  me this is a very convenient and  efficient game changer for log cutters  the multifunctional hammer  next we get into the realm of  multi-functionality this tool would make  the ordinary toolbox lonely if it were  to replace some of the tools the  multifunctional hammer is designed to  serve as a hammer power nail gun nail  puller pipe plier wrench screwdriver  clamps pincers vise and spanner weighing  600 grams this stainless steel tool's  multiple functionalities are adjustable  to be able to work on varying materials  and sizes because of its various and  wide application it is suitable for  house furniture repair outdoor camping  factory processing and everything in  between the multifunctional ratchet w  with 180 degrees rotating head still on  multifunctional tools i found another  amazing tool the multifunctional ratchet  w with 180 degrees rotating head it  comes in two sizes the 10 inch and the 8  inch the 10 inch wrench is 260  millimeters long and can reach a maximum  opening of 32 millimeters while the 8  inch wrench has a maximum opening of 24  millimeters at 204 millimeters long it's  made of steel and can be folded up to  allow for work in hard to reach places  the ratchet's fixed mode has a  tightening feature that can be adjusted  continuously while in use and it has a  handy magic button that switches the  ratchet on and off to use it as a  ratchet wrench or a traditional wrench  pivot ladder tool  from multi-functionality to simple  functionality we move on to the  provision tools pivot ladder tool the  pivot ladder tool is the ultimate ladder  accessory it gives a stable platform for  most ladders and works well on uneven  ground making ladder use safer this tool  requires no bolts or clamps and moving  from one ladder to another requires no  special equipment it can be used as a  ladder jack indoors and out on rooftops  and stairs as well as a mini shelf for  your tools when attached to the ladder  with hundreds of rubber gripper feet  made from rugged conveyor belt material  the pivot tool will keep the ladder from  slipping since we will all have to  change a bulb at some point or another  this is a great tool to have kexel  montelet mosaic glass and tile nippers  another amazing tool i found is the  kexel montelet mosaic glass and tile  nippers the italian company montelet  took the wheeled nipper to a whole new  level these professional level wheel  nippers are tough enough to shape marble  and porcelain yet gentle enough for  glass the entire tool is made of steel  tungsten and titanium pretty strong  materials so you know they're tough the  nippers have smaller angled wheels for  greater material access and straight cut  the handles are a bit longer at 10  inches to give that little extra  leverage needed when cutting harder  materials this one could be reserved for  the professionals but it does belong  here casper hamilton core axe this next  tool is a classic example of functional  creativity imagine having an axe with  interchangeable heads while you imagine  that casper hamilton has already gone  ahead and made the casper hamilton corex  this tool package consists of a health  and two interchangeable heads its  straight shaft health is made from a  carbon fiber and ashwood sandwich to pay  homage to the heritage of a traditional  axe the two heads are a 1200 gm felling  head and a 1 500 gm splitting head both  made out of reheated carbon steel the  weight of the axe is therefore focused  at the head giving greater striking  momentum and efficiency when cutting or  splitting wood each head is specially  designed to be optimal for its own  different functions this one seems like  the perfect companion for outdoors men  and women paint hedging tool  the next tool will change how you feel  about painting edges the paint edging  tool quickly and meticulously paints  edges around baseboards window trims  doors and ceilings without the mess the  tool has a hollow handle that holds  almost five ounces of paint all you need  to do is slowly press the trigger to  feed paint directly to the paint pad  when painting the pad soaks up the paint  evenly to give off consistent paint any  remaining paint can be squeezed back  into the can which is also very  economical if you want to go pro next  time you have a diy paint project this  is the perfect tool and when you're done  with it it is easily cleaned by rinsing  the tool in and out using water or any  cleaning liquid if you enjoyed this  video hit the subscribe button and  continue watching by clicking on one of  the cards on your screen see you at the  next one
 

